      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 18%",
      "body": "After last week's 18% share price gain to ₹2,458, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 27x. Average forward P/E is 22x in the Luxury industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 138% over the past three years.",
